</figure>
<figure id="S3.F21" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.13353v1/x21.svg" id="S3.F21.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:191/132;" width="191" height="132"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S3.F21.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 21</span>: </span><span id="S3.F21.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Class distribution in CIFAR100 training set</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="S3.SS2.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS2.p6.1" class="ltx_p">The hybrid model’s predictions demonstrate better handling of intra-class variation compared to the classical model, particularly for fine-grained categories that require subtle feature discrimination.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S3.F22" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="S3.F22.sf1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2509.13353v1/x22.png" id="S3.F22.sf1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/79;" width="476" height="79" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S3.F22.sf1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(a)</span> </span><span id="S3.F22.sf1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Hybrid model predictions</span></figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="S3.F22.sf2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2509.13353v1/x23.png" id="S3.F22.sf2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/79;" width="476" height="79" alt="Refer to caption">
